 * Purpose: Data behind Admin → Images (US 03.06.01 browse, US 03.03.01 remove): campsite promo images
 *   and entrants' profile pictures (US 01.08.02) in one list.
 * Role / Design Pattern: Pure list-building object plus a Repository Pattern interface with Firestore and
